Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.12,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:21.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:33.52,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.84,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.69,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:54.04,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.29,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.61,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.00,0:01:52.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's been a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.80,0:01:55.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Ceng Niu is still as graceful as before.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.52,0:01:55.48,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(424,467)}Mo Zhi\NEnvoy of the Cultivation Alliance
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.92,0:01:58.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Mo Zhi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.40,0:02:00.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.32,0:02:02.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,You, step back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.20,0:02:06.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have a question,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.72,0:02:08.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,I hope Brother Ceng Niu can answer it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.08,0:02:11.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why did you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.08,0:02:14.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,refuse to become the next Suzaku ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.72,0:02:16.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,So that's how it is...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.76,0:02:20.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's not that the Cultivation Planet Crystal chose me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.64,0:02:21.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,but rather...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.44,0:02:24.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,he chose me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.32,0:02:26.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,My ambitions
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.60,0:02:27.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,are higher than planet Suzaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.36,0:02:31.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a shame...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.76,0:02:33.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since Brother Ceng Niu made up his mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.36,0:02:36.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,then I will not try to persuade you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.76,0:02:52.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Repair.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.56,0:02:55.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the Cultivation Planet Heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.08,0:02:57.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,The one who obtains it,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.68,0:02:59.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,becomes the next Suzaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.92,0:03:01.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Cultivation Planet Heart...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.64,0:03:04.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,But my cultivation is too low...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.64,0:03:07.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,The one who obtains it can directly become the Suzaku ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.32,0:03:12.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Middle stage Soul Transformation ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.32,0:03:15.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,How did her cultivation increase so drastically ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.36,0:03:16.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.80,0:03:18.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,This aura...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.96,0:03:20.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's Qian Feng !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.72,0:03:23.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,A cultivation furnace
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.60,0:03:25.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,that was able to reverse her fate ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.28,0:03:27.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,How rare...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.72,0:03:30.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Azure Dragon bloodline,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.00,0:03:33.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,you are also a qualified candidate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.76,0:03:34.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.00,0:03:37.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,you are not Soul Transformation
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.08,0:03:38.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,so you won't be respected.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.28,0:03:44.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,In that case,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.52,0:03:47.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,the next Suzaku shall be...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.00,0:03:50.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Mo, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.48,0:03:53.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although he hasn’t reached Soul Transformation,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.28,0:03:54.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,that doesn’t mean he never will.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.72,0:03:57.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.84,0:03:58.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,what do you mean by that ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.56,0:04:00.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,What does Brother Mo think ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.96,0:04:03.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.88,0:04:07.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your Billion-Soul Flag is useless now
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.68,0:04:09.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,and you are just Early stage Soul Transformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.60,0:04:11.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I want to kill you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.20,0:04:13.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,it would be as easy as waving my hand !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.60,0:04:15.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,And if I agree to become the next Suzaku ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.84,0:04:16.36,Sub,,0,0,0,0,You !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.80,0:04:28.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Ceng Niu, have you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.72,0:04:30.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,changed your mind ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.28,0:04:31.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you really need to ask ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.96,0:04:33.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even if I become the Suzaku,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.88,0:04:35.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,I would just pass the title
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.96,0:04:36.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.84,0:04:42.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Interesting...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.92,0:04:43.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Interesting...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.48,0:04:45.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,In that case,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.04,0:04:47.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,from now on,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.20,0:04:50.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,you are the 15th generation Suzaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.64,0:04:53.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,I hope you will cultivate diligently here,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.40,0:04:56.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,and properly comprehend the Suzaku Seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.48,0:05:37.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Forsaken Immortal Clan,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.08,0:05:41.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can give you a third of planet Suzaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.48,0:05:43.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,But every thousand years,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.12,0:05:47.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,you must deliver at least a 9-Leaf's skull.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.84,0:05:48.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yunque Zi,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.80,0:05:50.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,do you agree ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.48,0:05:58.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.48,0:06:09.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.08,0:06:11.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's nothing,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.36,0:06:12.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,you don't need to thank me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.28,0:06:15.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Ceng Niu,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.68,0:06:19.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,I may need your help in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.12,0:06:22.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,I hope you will not refuse then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.08,0:06:24.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.76,0:06:27.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must now return to the Cultivation Alliance to report,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.92,0:06:30.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,would Brother Ceng Niu like to leave with me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.68,0:06:33.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I still have some matters to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.64,0:06:37.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Use your celestial spiritual energy in this seal
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.20,0:06:38.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,and you can leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.48,0:06:42.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Ceng Niu,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.88,0:06:44.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,the path of immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.16,0:06:45.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,I hope that
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.68,0:06:48.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,we will meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.08,0:06:58.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have obtained both my and Wan'er's soul strand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.56,0:07:00.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,No one can control our lives anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.48,0:07:03.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Billion-Soul Flag is greatly weakened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.28,0:07:05.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,After I leave,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.84,0:07:08.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,I need to find enough souls to repair it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.48,0:07:11.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,The next Suzaku is Zhou Wutai.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.68,0:07:13.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,He is a grateful and righteous man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.48,0:07:15.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even if I leave,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.08,0:07:18.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,he will take good care of my acquaintances.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.40,0:07:20.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,That means
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.60,0:07:23.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,I no longer need to worry about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.92,0:07:26.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Xu Liguo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.28,0:07:33.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.52,0:07:36.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have tamed this half-moon blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.64,0:07:37.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's very obedient.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.32,0:07:39.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,This half-moon blade is pretty mysterious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.52,0:07:41.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it will be useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.84,0:07:42.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,Number Four,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.00,0:07:44.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,come and greet Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.12,0:07:52.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Greetings,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.52,0:07:54.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.08,0:07:56.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,This half-moon blade is hard to tame,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.68,0:07:59.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can't even imprint my Divine Sense on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.32,0:08:02.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,But somehow, it really likes Xu Liguo...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.72,0:08:05.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Alright,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.36,0:08:08.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,as long as I can control it indirectly
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.44,0:08:09.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,and make it serve me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.00,0:08:13.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Number Four, let's go !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.00,0:08:28.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)\pos(1681,576)}1 year later
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.48,0:08:37.08,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)}Falling from the night sky
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.24,0:08:39.44,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)}and melting into dust
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.44,0:08:41.80,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}like water without a source.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.44,0:08:44.52,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500}Like the difference between clouds and mud,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.52,0:08:48.00,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,1000}the truth cannot be found in conflict.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.92,0:08:52.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500}Life and death\Nare like the moment when the rain falls.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.52,0:08:56.76,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500}And like many other unseparable things.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.80,0:08:59.40,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500}In this lifetime,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.40,0:09:01.84,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500}to cultivate the truth, cultivate the world first.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.24,0:09:09.60,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,1000}Old grudges had to be settled
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.64,0:09:09.60,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,1000}because half an inch is engraved into my tree rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.64,0:09:15.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,1000}Use the most vivid love and hate
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.60,0:09:15.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,1000}to ask questions to your fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.68,0:09:20.04,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300}Let your eyes be filled enough with rage\Nto pierce the heart and the soul
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.08,0:09:23.76,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}then soften because of the mortals' fireworks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.80,0:09:25.20,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500}Only when you bend
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.20,0:09:29.22,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500}can you understand the hidden edge of the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.60,0:09:31.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500}The human mind is nature,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.64,0:09:33.76,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300}the rain fell silently like an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.80,0:09:35.48,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500}Life and death are just moments away,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.48,0:09:38.00,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500}there are many other solutions to grudges.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.04,0:09:43.19,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000}Use your dusty heart\Nto depict the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.32,0:09:47.48,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300}One stroke is for killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.76,0:09:47.48,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}After struggling for hundreds of years, I endured letting go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.52,0:09:51.48,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500}One stroke is for caring.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.24,0:09:51.48,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500}Everywhere there is life, there are thousands of lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.64,0:09:56.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000}Give up your mind to be refined\Nby this endless world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.84,0:10:03.36,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Snow falls as my hair turns white, winter withers\Nwhile prosperity sprouts in summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.08,0:10:09.80,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}I step into the world, with light at my fingertips,\Nthe law of cause and effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.64,0:10:16.24,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}I observe the vastness of heaven and earth\Nso I can get rid of evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.75,0:10:23.84,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,1000}Obsession arises from one thought, life and death arise from one thought.\NReincarnation is not to be feared.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.84,0:08:47.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Over the past year,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.84,0:08:52.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Forsaken Immortal Clan retreated to the northwest of planet Suzaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.40,0:08:55.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,From now on, they will no longer bother the cultivators.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.68,0:09:00.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,After this war,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.36,0:09:03.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,more than half of planet Suzaku's cultivators died.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.04,0:09:06.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Most sects and countries are severely weakened.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.48,0:09:08.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Forsaken Immortal Clan retreated,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.76,0:09:10.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,we have driven them away !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.28,0:09:11.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is great, we won !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.68,0:09:15.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Zhou Wutai knew that he needed to be respected.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.28,0:09:17.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,So right after leaving the Suzaku Tomb,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.20,0:09:19.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,he went into seclusion on Mount Suzaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.68,0:09:22.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,As for Zi Xin and Liu Mei,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.00,0:09:25.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,I heard that both of them flew into the starry sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.44,0:09:29.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wanted to recover the 4th primary soul that Zhuque Zi stole,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.64,0:09:31.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,but I wasn't able to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.48,0:09:41.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little Ru'er is luckier than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.84,0:09:43.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,At least she has a home to return to
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.68,0:09:45.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,and a chance to live with her parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.72,0:09:50.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,If Little Ru'er ever cultivates to Nascent Soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.60,0:09:54.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tie Yan will give this to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.84,0:09:58.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Before leaving,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.88,0:10:01.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,I went to the old country of Xue Yue.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.08,0:10:05.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even in this bitter cold,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.04,0:10:07.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,I still found
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.08,0:10:09.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,flowers blooming.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.56,0:10:26.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Finally,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.32,0:10:29.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,I returned to the place where I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.04,0:10:41.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,My son, it doesn't matter if you are not chosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.56,0:10:42.08,Second,,0,0,0,,Tie Zhu, you really look like an Immortal now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.08,0:10:43.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can always come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.16,0:10:44.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Noooo !!!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.12,0:10:51.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.08,0:10:53.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.56,0:10:58.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your son is going to leave…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.40,0:11:33.48,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(437,467)}Country of Zhou\NRank 4 cultivation country
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.76,0:11:36.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Keep playing music !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.68,0:11:38.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Keep dancing !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.84,0:11:39.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your Highness,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.88,0:11:41.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,let me dance another song for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.88,0:11:43.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Situ,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.44,0:11:44.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.52,0:11:46.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,That was too quick...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.80,0:11:50.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.16,0:11:52.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,do you want to know why I cultivate ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.00,0:11:55.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.44,0:11:58.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,I cultivate because I want all treasures and women
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.36,0:12:00.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,of this world to be mine !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.56,0:12:02.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I didn't keep running into strong enemies,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.12,0:12:05.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,that forced me to cultivate to beat them,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.64,0:12:07.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,I would have quit
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.04,0:12:08.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,cultivating long ago !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.96,0:12:13.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Situ,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.28,0:12:16.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,your Dao and mine are different.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.92,0:12:21.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.36,0:12:24.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's make our own cultivation country.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.64,0:12:29.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fool...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.16,0:12:41.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the cloud barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.84,0:12:43.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,After we cross it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.08,0:12:44.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,we will have left planet Suzaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.60,0:12:46.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Original body,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.60,0:12:47.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,come !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.28,0:13:09.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Good !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.20,0:13:12.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Like this, you are Peak Middle stage Soul Transformation !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.56,0:13:23.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Disperse for me !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.64,0:13:36.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Wang,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.88,0:13:38.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,have a safe journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.44,0:13:46.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,The younger generations will always surpass us...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.36,0:13:54.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uncle ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.40,0:13:58.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Ancestor !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.52,0:14:05.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.68,0:14:06.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,at this speed
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.24,0:14:08.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,we will reach
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.40,0:14:09.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,the trade planet in a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.11,0:14:11.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.56,0:14:13.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,I almost forgot this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.32,0:14:15.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,While you were gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.40,0:14:17.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,I took a stroll around Forsaken Immortal Clan
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.08,0:14:19.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,and picked up a bunch of these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.40,0:14:21.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's for you, take them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.08,0:14:23.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.68,0:14:26.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're going to planet Tian Yun, right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.16,0:14:27.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,You must get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.68,0:14:32.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,After watching you fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.68,0:14:34.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,I think you rely too much on artifacts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.00,0:14:36.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your spells aren't that good...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.92,0:14:37.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since that's the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.92,0:14:39.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will teach you 3 spells !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.28,0:14:41.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,I created these 3 spells
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.28,0:14:45.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,with my insights after thousands of years of cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.88,0:14:47.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Their power is unmatched.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.80,0:14:48.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.72,0:14:51.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,you're the only person I will ever pass these to !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.84,0:15:03.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Death Finger !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.24,0:15:27.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Demonic Finger !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.36,0:15:33.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,These are...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.76,0:15:34.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,demonic flames ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.68,0:15:36.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the final move...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.12,0:15:37.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.28,0:15:38.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,watch closely !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.60,0:15:53.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Underworld Finger !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.48,0:16:01.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's go,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.56,0:16:02.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,spar with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.36,0:16:05.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let me see how much you've learned !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.84,0:16:13.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)\pos(202,645)}1 month later
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.32,0:16:19.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not bad, not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.00,0:16:21.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't need to worry about you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.92,0:16:23.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you want to know something else,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.48,0:16:24.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,ask me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.04,0:16:26.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Situ,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.40,0:16:28.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,what is there
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.52,0:16:29.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,after Ascendant ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.68,0:16:31.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cultivators embarking on the path of immortality
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.20,0:16:34.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,all believe that cultivation begins with Qi Condensation
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.84,0:16:36.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,and ends with Ascendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.96,0:16:37.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,But they don't realize
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.92,0:16:40.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,that this is merely the first step.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.84,0:16:42.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Above this...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.60,0:16:45.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,there is a second step.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.68,0:16:46.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,The second step ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.68,0:16:47.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Exactly !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.76,0:16:51.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ye Wuyou and I obtained this information from the Cultivation Alliance back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.88,0:16:52.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,The second step
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.88,0:16:55.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,is called the 3 realms of Nirvana Shattering:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.44,0:16:57.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nirvana Scryer,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.08,0:16:59.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nirvana Cleanser,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.56,0:17:01.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,and finally Nirvana Shatterer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.28,0:17:02.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,These realms
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.32,0:17:04.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,are the path beyond Ascendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.48,0:17:06.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is your cultivation
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.04,0:17:08.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nirvana Scryer ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.48,0:17:10.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's not that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.56,0:17:12.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Before the second step,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.32,0:17:13.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,there are still two trials:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.08,0:17:15.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Illusory Yin an Corporeal Yang.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.92,0:17:17.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,A cultivator's domain
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.00,0:17:19.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,will be tempered by the Illusory Yin and Corporeal Yang stages.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.32,0:17:22.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Only then will you be able to enter Nirvana Scryer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.84,0:17:26.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,We've arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.08,0:17:29.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,No matter what materials you need,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.44,0:17:30.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,this trade planet
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.68,0:17:32.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,will definitely have them !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.64,0:17:32.20,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(423,477)\fad(300,000)}Trade Planet\NAlliance Star System
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.04,0:17:34.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.08,0:17:36.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm going ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.40,0:17:37.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,to plunder to my heart's content !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.20,0:17:39.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can look around by yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.68,0:17:41.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,let's meet in 3 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.60,0:17:49.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,I hope that this trade planet
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.80,0:17:52.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,has materials to refine my Star Compass.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.08,0:17:58.20,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(424,462)}Ming Mei City\NTrade Planet
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.72,0:18:01.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Feel free to pick whatever you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.32,0:18:04.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,I thought it would take more effort
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.24,0:18:06.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,to buy this Void Wood Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.39,0:18:07.27,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(460,432)}Void Wood Stone
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.44,0:18:09.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,This trade planet is pretty convenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.68,0:18:12.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,I just need some Snow Ink,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.48,0:18:15.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,but I can't find it anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.60,0:18:20.48,Shop,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(994,271)}Shang clan’s shop
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.40,0:18:20.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,I heard this Shang clan's shop claims to have everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.92,0:18:23.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Maybe they have some...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.20,0:18:29.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stop right here !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.08,0:18:33.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,You !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.48,0:18:35.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a place for nobles.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.28,0:18:37.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.72,0:18:38.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Get out of here !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.16,0:18:43.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,A fight started !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.88,0:18:48.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Such fast attacks,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.92,0:18:49.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,look !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.52,0:18:55.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Young Master, save me !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.48,0:18:56.08,Second,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.28,0:19:05.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Star Rotation !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.16,0:19:07.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Note: this is another spell Situ Nan taught that wasn't shown.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.44,0:19:12.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,You actually ruined my cultivation foundation !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.44,0:19:19.60,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1519,471)}Bai Wei\NHeavenly Fate Sect Purple Division disciple\NMiddle stage Soul Transformation
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.04,0:19:18.40,Second,,0,0,0,,It's already over...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.68,0:19:19.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Impressive spell, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.68,0:19:22.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,May I know what your name is ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.84,0:19:24.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.40,0:19:26.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.44,0:19:28.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am Bai Wei.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.76,0:19:30.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Young Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.52,0:19:31.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,kill him !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.56,0:19:33.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Wang,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.08,0:19:35.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,my servant was rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.48,0:19:36.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please don't be offended.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.32,0:19:38.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am from planet Tian Yun,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.84,0:19:40.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,a disciple of the Heavenly Fate Sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.52,0:19:43.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,May I ask where Brother Wang is from ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.64,0:19:45.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm a rogue cultivator
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.04,0:19:47.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,without a sect or planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.84,0:19:53.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since Brother Wang is unwilling to speak,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.04,0:19:55.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,then I will not inquire any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.80,0:20:00.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,My master celebrates his birthday every 10 000 years and it's very soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.08,0:20:01.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,If Brother Wang has time,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.76,0:20:03.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,please come to planet Tian Yun
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.88,0:20:06.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,and allow me to be your host.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.60,0:20:17.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Young master, have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.48,0:20:19.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,So expensive !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.04,0:20:21.28,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(507,428)}Snow Ink
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.24,0:20:24.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,In Ming Mei City
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.28,0:20:25.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,at the Shang clan's shop,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.60,0:20:26.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want the Snow Ink.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.96,0:20:27.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stop running !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.36,0:20:29.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stop this !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.56,0:20:35.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come on, come on !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.68,0:20:37.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thief, return my Snow Ink !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.32,0:20:41.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm not some young lady,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.00,0:20:42.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,why are you idiots chasing after me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.44,0:20:44.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're not getting away !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.68,0:20:54.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here, Snow Ink.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.32,0:20:57.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little Lin...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.68,0:21:01.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.64,0:21:07.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can finally live like a king.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.84,0:21:09.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm sure we'll meet again...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.44,0:21:13.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's right !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.76,0:21:16.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm going to enjoy the rest of my life
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.68,0:21:17.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,to the fullest.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.28,0:21:29.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,A celestial artifact !?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.12,0:21:32.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it's infinitely close to middle grade ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.16,0:21:36.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kid, how did you obtain so many treasures ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.48,0:21:43.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.48,0:21:46.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,the method to control this celestial artifact ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.32,0:21:50.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.36,0:21:52.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,are you giving me this God Slaying Chariot ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.08,0:21:58.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,What ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.64,0:22:00.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,You don't want it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.12,0:22:02.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who said I didn't want it !?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.48,0:22:11.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.68,0:22:13.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,planet Tian Yun is filled with strangers,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.76,0:22:14.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.48,0:22:19.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,However, you can’t forget your pride as a cultivator of planet Suzaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.28,0:22:20.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you have any problems,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.88,0:22:22.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,come find me on planet Feng Luan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.32,0:22:24.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,With this old man around,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.76,0:22:26.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,no one will dare to mess with you !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.60,0:22:29.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't get ahead of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.72,0:22:32.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you ever get your ass kicked,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.72,0:22:34.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,come find me on planet Tian Yun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.16,0:22:36.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,With me around,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.48,0:22:38.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,no one will dare to touch you !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.32,0:22:40.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Keep that mentality !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.68,0:22:42.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fine,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.16,0:22:44.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,if I'm ever in trouble,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.48,0:22:46.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll come and find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.16,0:22:49.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,You better make a name for yourself !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.48,0:22:50.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because I'll be ashamed
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.88,0:22:52.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,if you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.32,0:23:02.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.24,0:23:04.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.64,0:23:10.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wonder if
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.08,0:23:13.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,we will have another chance to meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.68,0:23:16.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Situ,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.20,0:23:17.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.52,0:23:21.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,I, Wang Lin, have never in my life
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.76,0:23:23.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,bowed to the heavens or the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.08,0:23:26.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,I pay respects to neither ghosts or gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.40,0:23:28.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,I only bow to my parents
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.00,0:23:30.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,and pay respects to Situ...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.91,0:26:22.07,Note,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}There is an after credits scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.03,0:24:06.33,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}To let go of the consequences of my actions
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.33,0:24:08.05,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}is to ignore the law of cause and effect
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.09,0:24:09.99,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}like scattered ink.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.87,0:24:17.47,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}As destiny falls
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.71,0:24:17.47,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.47,0:24:25.07,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}It makes the mountains lose their colors,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.71,0:24:25.07,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}wither and melt into rivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.51,0:24:32.63,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Who can deceive
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.27,0:24:32.63,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}the law of the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.95,0:24:35.95,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Countless generations
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.23,0:24:35.95,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}have tried before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.24,0:24:39.67,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}But how could I not catch my dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.07,0:24:39.67,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}within my warm fingers ?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.23,0:24:43.75,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}You're at my side when I'm alone
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.75,0:24:47.07,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.83,0:24:51.03,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.39,0:24:55.23,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.23,0:24:55.23,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}in the streets.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.39,0:25:00.19,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.95,0:25:00.19,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Can I break the rules ?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.20,0:25:02.91,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}To run towards you !
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.95,0:25:06.23,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.23,0:25:10.87,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}to cut down this tribulation with my own hands
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.87,0:25:14.27,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}and break through the reincarnation cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.31,0:25:18.95,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}All of that for the stars in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.40,0:25:24.63,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.75,0:25:28.55,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}If your soul is willing to wander,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.55,0:25:33.19,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}can I still take your hands
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.23,0:25:33.19,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}and hold them tight ?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.35,0:25:36.27,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.27,0:25:41.15,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.16,0:25:44.43,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I dream of destroying
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.59,0:25:49.15,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}the shackles of our fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.15,0:25:53.11,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.11,0:25:55.91,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}You're the hardest to let go of.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.99,0:25:59.79,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I want to be with you again
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.87,0:26:03.15,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}so I can look in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.43,0:26:08.39,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Even for a moment, it's worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.19,0:26:38.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.87,0:26:40.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Next time,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.51,0:26:41.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,you definitely
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.63,0:26:45.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,won't escape my grasp !
